  "subject": "Why I’m running",
  "text": "Dear {{first_name}},

I’ve coached Little League in this town for eleven years. Last spring our field flooded for the third season in a row, and nobody at the county could tell me who was responsible for fixing the drain.

That’s when I decided to run for County Commission. I’m not backed by a party or big donors. I’m backed by neighbors who want a county that answers the phone.

If you have a question for me, just reply to this email. I read every one.

See where I stand https://example.org/sam-ortega/issues

Thank you,
Sam Ortega
Independent candidate for County Commission

 

