{
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light only"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light only"/><title>Town hall on the Elm Street repaving</title><style>:root{color-scheme:light only;supported-color-schemes:light only}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.em-bg{background-color:#EFF5FF !important}.em-card{background-color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-header{background-color:#1E63EC !important}.em-rule{background-color:#1E63EC !important}.em-band{background-color:#1E63EC !important}.em-divider{background-color:#D6E7FF !important}.em-accent{background-color:#DC1438 !important}.em-cta{background-color:#1E63EC !important}.em-header-text{color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-headline{color:#0B1529 !important}.em-subheading{color:#1E63EC !important}.em-body{color:#1D305C !important}.em-meta{color:#1D305C !important}.em-cta-text{color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-cta-link{color:#1E63EC !important}.em-accent-text{color:#FFFFFF !important}}@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.em-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}.em-page{padding-left:0 !important;padding-right:0 !important}}</style></head><body bgcolor="#EFF5FF" class="em-bg" style="background-color:#EFF5FF;margin:0;padding:0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0" data-skip-in-text="true">Tell us what the construction schedule should work around.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#EFF5FF;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#EFF5FF" class="em-bg" style="background-color:#EFF5FF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#EFF5FF" class="em-bg em-page" style="background-color:#EFF5FF;padding:24px 12px;text-align:left"><table role="presentation" width="600" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;margin:0 auto"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#1E63EC" class="em-rule" style="background-color:#1E63EC;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#1E63EC" class="em-rule" height="6" style="background-color:#1E63EC;padding:0;text-align:left;height:6px;line-height:6px;font-size:1px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><img alt="Elm Street at the corner of Second Avenue" src="https://app.goodparty.org/images/email-samples/street.jpg" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto" width="600"/><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card em-pad" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px 20px;text-align:center"><h1 class="em-headline" style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#0B1529;font-size:36px;line-height:45px;font-weight:800;text-align:center">Elm Street is getting repaved</h1><p class="em-body" style="font-size:17px;line-height:28px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><span>Hi {{first_name}}, work starts in the spring. Before we set the schedule, I want to hear from the people who live and work on Elm. Come tell me what the crews should plan around.</span></p><p class="em-body" style="font-size:17px;line-height:28px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><span>Tuesday, November 3, at 6:30pm in Room 2 at Riverton City Hall.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#1E63EC" class="em-band" style="background-color:#1E63EC;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#1E63EC" class="em-band em-pad" style="background-color:#1E63EC;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center"><table role="presentation" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin:0 auto"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#DC1438" class="em-accent" style="background-color:#DC1438;border-radius:6px"><a href="https://example.org/riverton/elm-street-town-hall" class="em-accent-text" style="color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration-line:none;display:inline-block;padding:18px 40px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:22px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">RSVP for the town hall</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#D6E7FF" class="em-divider" style="background-color:#D6E7FF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#D6E7FF" class="em-divider" height="1" style="background-color:#D6E7FF;padding:0;text-align:left;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card em-pad" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:24px 32px 32px;text-align:center"><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Paid for by Wells for Mayor</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">You’re getting this email because you asked to hear from Renee Wells.</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">916 Silver Spur Rd #310, Rolling Hills Estates, CA 90274</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" ses:no-track="" class="em-meta" style="color:#1D305C;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "subject": "Town hall on the Elm Street repaving",
  "text": " 


Elm Street is getting repaved

Hi {{first_name}}, work starts in the spring. Before we set the schedule, I want to hear from the people who live and work on Elm. Come tell me what the crews should plan around.

Tuesday, November 3, at 6:30pm in Room 2 at Riverton City Hall.

RSVP for the town hall https://example.org/riverton/elm-street-town-hall

 

Paid for by Wells for Mayor

You’re getting this email because you asked to hear from Renee Wells.

916 Silver Spur Rd #310, Rolling Hills Estates, CA 90274

Unsubscribe {{unsubscribe_url}}",
}
`;

