{
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light only"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light only"/><title>Knock doors with me this Saturday?</title><style>:root{color-scheme:light only;supported-color-schemes:light only}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.em-bg{background-color:#FFF1F2 !important}.em-card{background-color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-header{background-color:#DC1438 !important}.em-rule{background-color:#DC1438 !important}.em-band{background-color:#DC1438 !important}.em-divider{background-color:#FFD9DC !important}.em-accent{background-color:#FFC523 !important}.em-cta{background-color:#0048C2 !important}.em-header-text{color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-headline{color:#0B1529 !important}.em-subheading{color:#DC1438 !important}.em-body{color:#1D305C !important}.em-meta{color:#1D305C !important}.em-cta-text{color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-cta-link{color:#0048C2 !important}.em-accent-text{color:#060B17 !important}}@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.em-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}.em-page{padding-left:0 !important;padding-right:0 !important}}</style></head><body bgcolor="#FFF1F2" class="em-bg" style="background-color:#FFF1F2;margin:0;padding:0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0" data-skip-in-text="true">Two hours, one neighborhood, and coffee on me.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#FFF1F2;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFF1F2" class="em-bg" style="background-color:#FFF1F2;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#FFF1F2" class="em-bg em-page" style="background-color:#FFF1F2;padding:24px 12px;text-align:left"><table role="presentation" width="600" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;margin:0 auto"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#DC1438" class="em-rule" style="background-color:#DC1438;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#DC1438" class="em-rule" height="6" style="background-color:#DC1438;padding:0;text-align:left;height:6px;line-height:6px;font-size:1px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><img alt="Volunteers with clipboards on a sidewalk in Maple Heights" src="https://app.goodparty.org/images/email-samples/street.jpg" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto" width="600"/><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card em-pad" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px 20px;text-align:center"><h1 class="em-headline" style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#0B1529;font-size:36px;line-height:45px;font-weight:800;text-align:center">Help me meet Maple Heights</h1><p class="em-body" style="font-size:17px;line-height:28px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><span>Hi {{first_name}},</span></p><p class="em-body" style="font-size:17px;line-height:28px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><span>The election is four weeks out, and the best way to win is talking with voters face to face. Join me for two hours of door knocking. No experience needed. We’ll pair you with someone who has done it before.</span></p><p class="em-body" style="font-size:17px;line-height:28px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><span>Saturday, October 10, 10am to noon, at the Maple Heights Library, 210 Oak Street. Bring comfortable shoes and your phone.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#DC1438" class="em-band" style="background-color:#DC1438;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#DC1438" class="em-band em-pad" style="background-color:#DC1438;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center"><table role="presentation" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin:0 auto"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#FFC523" class="em-accent" style="background-color:#FFC523;border-radius:6px"><a href="https://example.org/jordan-ellis/canvass" class="em-accent-text" style="color:#060B17;text-decoration-line:none;display:inline-block;padding:18px 40px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:22px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Save my spot</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFD9DC" class="em-divider" style="background-color:#FFD9DC;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#FFD9DC" class="em-divider" height="1" style="background-color:#FFD9DC;padding:0;text-align:left;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card em-pad" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:24px 32px 32px;text-align:center"><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Paid for by Wells for Mayor</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">You’re getting this email because you asked to hear from Renee Wells.</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">916 Silver Spur Rd #310, Rolling Hills Estates, CA 90274</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0;color:#1D305C;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" ses:no-track="" class="em-meta" style="color:#1D305C;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "subject": "Knock doors with me this Saturday?",
  "text": " 


Help me meet Maple Heights

Hi {{first_name}},

The election is four weeks out, and the best way to win is talking with voters face to face. Join me for two hours of door knocking. No experience needed. We’ll pair you with someone who has done it before.

Saturday, October 10, 10am to noon, at the Maple Heights Library, 210 Oak Street. Bring comfortable shoes and your phone.

Save my spot https://example.org/jordan-ellis/canvass

 

Paid for by Wells for Mayor

You’re getting this email because you asked to hear from Renee Wells.

916 Silver Spur Rd #310, Rolling Hills Estates, CA 90274

Unsubscribe {{unsubscribe_url}}",
}
`;
